{
  "spec": 1,
  "id": "envanter-sagligi",
  "title": "Envanter sağlığı",
  "description": "Stok durumu, yeniden sipariş önerileri ve fazla stok. Yalnızca okunur; onay işlemleri satış panosundaki envanter bölümündedir.",
  "tags": [
    "envanter",
    "stok"
  ],
  "locale": "tr-TR",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "roles": [
    "admin",
    "purchasing"
  ],
  "time": {
    "dimension": "inventory_health.last_sale_date"
  },
  "filters": [
    {
      "id": "durum",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.status",
      "label": "Durum"
    },
    {
      "id": "kategori",
      "dimension": "products.category",
      "label": "Kategori"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_tedarikci_1",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.vendor_name",
      "label": "Vendor name",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "tedarikci"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_siparis_1",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.product_name",
      "label": "Product name",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "siparis"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_siparis_3",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.on_hand",
      "label": "On hand",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "siparis"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_siparis_4",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.on_order",
      "label": "On order",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "siparis"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_siparis_5",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.days_of_cover",
      "label": "Days of cover",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "siparis"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_siparis_6",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.suggested_order_qty",
      "label": "Suggested order qty",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "siparis"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_siparis_7",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.suggested_order_value",
      "label": "Suggested order value",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "siparis"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_fazla_4",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.excess_units",
      "label": "Excess units",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "fazla"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_fazla_5",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.excess_value",
      "label": "Excess value",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "fazla"
    },
    {
      "id": "xf_fazla_6",
      "dimension": "inventory_health.suggested_discount_pct",
      "label": "Suggested discount pct",
      "implicit": true,
      "source": "fazla"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": "ozet",
      "type": "kpi",
      "measures": [
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.product_count",
          "label": "Ürün",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.stockout_items",
          "label": "Stoksuz",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.reorder_items",
          "label": "Sipariş gerekli",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.overstock_items",
          "label": "Fazla stok",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.suggested_order_value_total",
          "label": "Önerilen sipariş tutarı",
          "format": "money"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.excess_value_total",
          "label": "Fazla stok tutarı",
          "format": "money"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "durumlar",
      "type": "bar",
      "title": "Duruma göre ürün sayısı",
      "measure": "inventory_health.product_count",
      "by": "inventory_health.status",
      "sort": "desc",
      "limit": 8,
      "format": "int",
      "on_click": {
        "set_filter": "durum"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tedarikci",
      "type": "bar",
      "title": "Tedarikçiye göre önerilen sipariş tutarı",
      "measure": "inventory_health.suggested_order_value_total",
      "by": "inventory_health.vendor_name",
      "sort": "desc",
      "limit": 10,
      "format": "money",
      "on_click": {
        "set_filter": [
          "xf_tedarikci_1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "siparis",
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Yeniden sipariş listesi",
      "columns": [
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.product_name",
          "label": "Ürün"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.status",
          "label": "Durum"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.on_hand",
          "label": "Eldeki",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.on_order",
          "label": "Siparişte",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.days_of_cover",
          "label": "Kapsama (gün)",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.suggested_order_qty",
          "label": "Önerilen adet",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.suggested_order_value",
          "label": "Önerilen tutar",
          "format": "money"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.vendor_name",
          "label": "Tedarikçi"
        }
      ],
      "order": {
        "inventory_health.suggested_order_value": "desc"
      },
      "limit": 25,
      "on_click": {
        "set_filter": [
          "xf_siparis_1",
          "durum",
          "xf_siparis_3",
          "xf_siparis_4",
          "xf_siparis_5",
          "xf_siparis_6",
          "xf_siparis_7",
          "xf_tedarikci_1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fazla",
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Fazla ve ölü stok",
      "columns": [
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.product_name",
          "label": "Ürün"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.status",
          "label": "Durum"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.on_hand",
          "label": "Eldeki",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.excess_units",
          "label": "Fazla adet",
          "format": "int"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.excess_value",
          "label": "Fazla tutar",
          "format": "money"
        },
        {
          "member": "inventory_health.suggested_discount_pct",
          "label": "Önerilen indirim %",
          "format": "int"
        }
      ],
      "order": {
        "inventory_health.excess_value": "desc"
      },
      "limit": 25,
      "on_click": {
        "set_filter": [
          "xf_siparis_1",
          "durum",
          "xf_siparis_3",
          "xf_fazla_4",
          "xf_fazla_5",
          "xf_fazla_6"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "not",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Not",
      "markdown": "Bu sayfa **demo verisi** üzerindedir. Tutarlar kaynakta ABD doları cinsindedir; burada yalnızca biçim (₺ simgesi, Türkçe ayraçlar) gösterilir, kur dönüşümü yapılmaz.\n"
    }
  ],
  "layout": [
    [
      {
        "panel": "ozet",
        "span": 12
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "panel": "durumlar",
        "span": 5
      },
      {
        "panel": "tedarikci",
        "span": 7
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "panel": "siparis",
        "span": 12
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "panel": "fazla",
        "span": 12
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "panel": "not",
        "span": 12
      }
    ]
  ],
  "members": {
